message: "Please cite the technical concept note using the preferred citation below; this repository does not provide a validated software implementation."
title: "Self-Calibrating Spatial Reaction-Mass Actuation Platform"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Dik"
    given-names: "Philipp"
abstract: >-
  An unvalidated concept for four independently controlled solid movers in
  spatially offset, interwoven closed guide paths with phase-dependent
  acceleration and braking. Compensation and three-axis torque authority
  require validation. Earlier one-mover and ground-robot embodiments are
  distinguished from the current four-path proposal.
url: "https://github.com/PhilDik/Self-Calibrating-Spatial-Reaction-Mass-Actuation-Platform-"
